# AI Agent Safety Guidelines

CRITICAL RULES:
1. NEVER create Pull Requests to upstream (LmeSzinc/AzurLaneAutoScript) or origin under any circumstances.
2. DO NOT use `gh pr create` or GitHub API to create PRs or issues.
3. NEVER push to `upstream`. Only push to `origin` (ZerowindSE/AzurLaneAutoScript).
4. All custom API and MCP code belongs in `module/api/`. Do not modify Alas upstream core files.
